# The frontend needs no build-time env variables in the managed deployment:
# the app always calls the same-origin '/api' — locally that is the Vite dev
# proxy to the Express server, and on Vercel the committed vercel.json proxies
# /api to the Render backend (bpin-crm.onrender.com). Same-origin requests keep
# the session cookie first-party, which is required for iOS/Safari.
#
# If you ever bypass the Vercel proxy and host the API on a different origin,
# set VITE_API_URL here (build-time) and also allow that origin via the
# backend's CLIENT_ORIGINS — not needed for the current setup.
